# Example file for local notes only. Do not commit real values.
# GitHub Actions secrets (set by run.sh via the sealed-box API):
#
# UPSTASH_BOX_API_KEY   (from BOX_API_KEY in the Upstash env file)
# UPSTASH_BOX_ID        (from BOX_ID)
# UPSTASH_BOX_BASE_URL  optional, defaults to https://us-east-1.box.upstash.com
#
# Optional, unused by the default equivalent workload:
# VEIL_BIN_URL
# VEIL_BIN_SHA256
# VEIL_WASM_URL
# VEIL_WASM_SHA256
